{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A psychological adventure through a dreamy landscape. Face unanswerable questions to reach the ultimate enigmas: Who are you? Who am I?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696210/extras/Ca_Answer_EN.png?t=1749177020\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>There is a mysterious creature donning a flower wreath, and it only refers to itself as <i>I</i>.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>I</i> will ask you questions, and the conversation will progress based on your answers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;What would you do if you could meet your past self?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;If you could buy other people's experiences with money, would you?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some of the questions will be things that you may have asked yourself already. Some may lead you to unexplored parts of your mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>There is no right answer. What matters is what you believe.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696210/extras/Donut_01_EN.gif?t=1749177020\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>After answering a question, you will be shown everyone else's answers.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">How many chose as you did? And why did the others choose differently?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into your own mind as you try to glance at someone else's.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696210/extras/DonutRate.gif?t=1749177020\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696210/extras/Caption_World_EN.png?t=1749177020\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Every door is connected to an answer. Go through the one you chose.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696210/extras/Door_1_EN.gif?t=1749177020\" />Your choices will change the room that you are in. Take a stroll through this visual representation of your own mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Maybe, after you've gone through enough doors, you will realize this world's secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696210/extras/Env.gif?t=1749177020\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696210/extras/Caption_Story_EN.png?t=1749177020\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Many questions await you. Some will be about common food items, while some will be about matters of life and death. None of them, however, have clear-cut answers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>You might wonder: why am I being asked these things in the first place?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you realize the reason between all of those questions, you may choose to face the reality hidden behind that simple donut hole.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But do so at your own discretion. If you go too deep, there's no guarantee you'll be able to come back up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696210/extras/Ca_Line_01.png?t=1749177020\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696210/extras/Ca_Characters_EN.png?t=1749177020\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>This is <i>I</i>.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696210/extras/I.png?t=1749177020\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A creature that loves talking, but remains vanishing and mysterious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>I</i> would like to ask you some questions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>This is <i>you</i>.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696210/extras/You.png?t=1749177020\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The choices <i>you</i> will take belong to  <i>you</i>, as they come from your own memories and experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696210/extras/Ca_Rebake_EN.png?t=1749177020\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Over a hundred new questions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- A new, expanded plot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Complex interactions between your answers and the plot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Improved graphics and new stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Backlog functions to see past questions and dialogue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- English and Chinese (simplified and traditional) support.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3696210?t=1749177020","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696210/84a9ae71324f9831c20b062c7cb2f42af73f4496/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749177020","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696210/f23b661e8cf1e877009aa70ba2b1e88f3d182bb7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749177020","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696210/f23b661e8cf1e877009aa70ba2b1e88f3