=1749177020\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696210/extras/Ca_Characters_EN.png?t=1749177020\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>This is <i>I</i>.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696210/extras/I.png?t=1749177020\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A creature that loves talking, but remains vanishing and mysterious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>I</i> would like to ask you some questions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>This is <i>you</i>.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696210/extras/You.png?t=1749177020\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The choices <i>you</i> will take belong to  <i>you</i>, as they come from your own memories and experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696210/extras/Ca_Rebake_EN.png?t=1749177020\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Over a hundred new questions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- A new, expanded plot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Complex interactions between your answers and the plot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Improved graphics and new stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Backlog functions to see past questions and dialogue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- English and Chinese (simplified and traditional) support.</p>","developers":["\u5bae\u6751\u3042\u3064\u304d","\u304b\u3053\u306e\u306b\u3053\u307f"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696210/ead2f9a0cb939cd1f2d94f1fd27480ffff9